=== Chests ===
; [[File:Eternal Chest.png|link=Eternal Chest]] [[Eternal Chest]]s
* Eternal Chests are similar in appearance to Gold Chests, except they glow bright blue instead of gold, like a [[soul heart]]. They require one key to unlock, but can be reopened a random amount of times, each time requiring another key. They can be found in [[Angel Room|Angel rooms]], in [[I AM ERROR|I AM ERROR Rooms]] and rarely in a normal room. Their loot is similar to Golden Chests, but there is a 25% chance they will drop nothing upon opening. If they contain nothing or an item, they will no longer be able to be reopened.
; [[File:Spiked Chest.png|link=Spiked Chest]] [[Spiked Chest]]s
* Spiked Chests are purple colored chests with spikes protruding from them that will deal damage to Isaac upon opening unless he has the [[Holy Mantle]] active, which nullifies the damage, or if found in [[The Chest]]/[[Dark Room]], where they are free to open. They can be rarely found upon completing a room or in greed mode shops. Their loot is similar to Brown Chests. Unlike other chests, they do not appear on the minimap.

=== Sacks ===
; [[File:Grab Bag.png|30px|link=Mystery sack]] [[Mystery sack]]
* Spawns 1-4 random pickups upon touching it. It will not drop any [[heart]]s, [[pill]]s or [[chest]]s, and they have an increased chance to drop [[battery|batteries]].

