=== Beggars ===
; [[File:Bomb Bum.png|60px|link=Bomb bum]] [[Bomb bum]]
Bomb Bums are extremely rare, and ask for bombs. Each bomb donated has a chance to have him drop 1-2 bomb pickups or an item from the Bomb Bum Item Pool. After spawning a pedestal item, the Bomb Bum will disappear and can no longer be donated to.

